Since the inception of '''''[[Strictly Come Dancing]]''''' in 2004, several special editions of the show have been transmitted by the [[BBC Television|BBC]] each year. These have included seasonal specials, charity specials, and variations of the ''Strictly Come Dancing'' format.

==Christmas Specials==
The '''Christmas Specials of ''[[Strictly Come Dancing]]''''' have been aired each year since 2004. Between 2004 and 2009, the specials feature celebrities from the current and past series. Between 2010 and 2013 and 2021 to 2025, the specials featured celebrities who were unable to compete in the main series due to time constrictions. From 2014 to 2019 and 2026 onwards the specials again featured contestants from previous series. With their professional dance partners, the celebrities perform their chosen Ballroom or Latin dance which is scored by the judges. The winning couple is then chosen by a studio audience vote.

